WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Looks like just another chatbot.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.050
Look at this request.

3
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.950
This one came in on Telegram.

4
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.050
“Put a page live for my free class.”

5
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.850
I break the request into tasks and choose who does each part.

6
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.700
Jonathan writes the copy.

7
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.800
Paulo puts the page live.

8
00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.500
And I create the promo carousel myself.

9
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.000
Before I send you the link, I check the whole page.

10
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.900
You sent me one sentence.

11
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.400
The team did the rest.

12
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.200
And you only talked to me.

13
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.800
Ask for a demo on WhatsApp.

14
00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.000
Put me to the test.
